<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1000s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 11th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1000s, 614 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 210 were founded and 135 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Byzantine Empire, the Abbasid Caliphate and the Liao dynasty.</p></header>
